				body: "Cream butter &amp; sugar.<br><br>Save 1 eggwhite for top. Beat remaining eggs and add to the butter.<br><br>Add lemon and nutmeg.<br><br>Sift tartar with flour and work into the butter.<br><br>Form into a ball, cover and chill for 1/2 hour.<br><br>Roll out to 1/4 inch thick.<br><br>Cut w/ cookie cutter (or soup can).<br><br>Brush with egg white (fork)<br><br>Sprinkle with sugar.<br><br>Bake at 375°F for 10 or 12 minutes.",
