				body: "Place the coriander leaves, chiles and peanuts in a food processor. Add the sugar and cumin and process to a smooth paste. Transfer to a bowl and stir in 3 tablespoons lemon juice and 1/4 tsp. salt. Taste and adjust the seasonings and the balance of tart and sweet as you wish.",
