				body: "Peel hard-boiled eggs, remove and discard 6 of the yolks; chop the remaining yolks and whites. Toss spinach and 2 tbs. dressing in a large bowl. Divide between 2 plates. Top with chopped eggs, beets, carrots and pecans. Drizzle with the remaining 2 tbs. dressing.",
